-theorem sh_P5_P7_rule (σ : SpeciesTree (Fin 5)) :
-    (σ.clusters = polytomy5 5 →
-      sh_middle σ = {2, 3, 4, 13} ∧ u σ 2 = u σ 3 ∧ u σ 4 = u σ 13 ∧
